  "prefLabel": "Env-A 4202.25 Floor coating",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 4202.25 “Floor coating” means an opaque coating formulated for application to areas that will be subjected to foot traffic, including but not limited to decks, porches, garage floors, and steps.\n\nSource. #8695, eff 7-27-06, ss by #10736, eff 1-1-15 (formerly Env-A 4202.01(y)); ss by #14202, eff 2-26-25",
